Environment, 232, 111181. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.rse.2019.04.034

NSR application reference:
Brown, M. S., Coops, N. C., Mulverhill, C., & Achim, A. (2025). Detection of
non-stand replacing disturbances (NSR) using Harmonized Landsat-Sentinel-2
time series. ISPRS Journal of Photogrammetry and Remote Sensing, 220,
264-276. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isprsjprs.2024.12.014
